cription factor KLF6 and its splice variants and promotes co-operative transactivation of common target genes through a Smad3-Sp1-KLF6 interaction. Biochem J. 2009;419(2):485-495.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC2882110</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">19076057</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Zhu YX, Benn S, Li ZH, et al. The SH3-SAM adaptor HACS1 is up-regulated in B cell activation signaling cascades. J Exp Med. 2004;200(6):737-747.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC2211965</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">15381729</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Blank U, Karlsson S. TGF-&#x3b2; signaling in the control of hematopoietic stem cells. Blood. 2015;125(23):3542-3550.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25833962</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Zhao M, Perry JM, Marshall H, et al. Megakaryocytes maintain homeostatic quiescence and promote post-injury regeneration of hematopoietic stem cells. Nat Med. 2014;20(11):1321-1326.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25326798</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Kuter DJ, Gminski DM, Rosenberg RD. Transforming growth factor beta inhibits megakaryocyte growth and endomitosis. Blood. 1992;79(3):619-626.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">1732007</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>van den Berk LC, Jansen BJ, Snowden S, et al. Cord blood mesenchymal stem cells suppress DC-T Cell proliferation via prostaglandin B2. Stem Cells Dev. 2014;23(14):1582-1593.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4085994</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">24649980</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Zhang YE. Non-Smad signaling pathways of the TGF-&#x3b2; family. Cold Spring Harb Perspect Biol. 2017;9(2):a022129.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC5287080</ArticleId><ArticleI